cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MemShift, please cite the paper below."
type: software
title: "MemShift"
abstract: >-
  MemShift measures whether what a memory derived about a person stays correct after the records,
  the person's definitions, the writer model or the memory product change. It applies controlled
  shifts to synthetic worlds with gold dependencies and scores every answer without an LLM judge.
version: "0.1.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/zichuanxu/memshift"
keywords:
